{0 transaction-dsl}

{v
# Transaction_dsl Module Reference

Composable transaction workflows (see ocaml/src/transaction_dsl.mli).

Core
- `'a t`
- `return : 'a -> 'a t`, `fail : Error.t -> 'a t`
- `bind` (`let*`), `let+`, `and+`

Execute queries
- `exec_cypher : 'a Cypher.t -> 'a t`
- `exec_query_builder : Query_builder.t -> Record.t list t`
- `exec_query_builder_unit : Query_builder.t -> unit t`

Control
- `commit : unit t`, `rollback : unit t`
- `when_ : bool -> unit t -> unit t`, `unless : bool -> unit t -> unit t`
- `sequence : 'a t list -> 'a list t`, `sequence_ : unit t list -> unit t`
- `iter : ('a -> unit t) -> 'a list -> unit t`, `map : ('a -> 'b t) -> 'a list -> 'b list t`

Errors
- `catch : 'a t -> (Error.t -> 'a t) -> 'a t`
- `try_with : 'a t -> on_error:'a t -> 'a t`

Run
- `run : 'a t -> Session.t -> ('a, Error.t) result`
- `run_exn : 'a t -> Session.t -> 'a`
- `get_session : Session.t t`, `lift_result : ('a, Error.t) result -> 'a t`
v}
